<title>USA: VWR Scientific Products Q1 sales, net rise.</title>
<headline>VWR Scientific Products Q1 sales, net rise.</headline>
<dateline>WEST CHESTER, Pa 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997		     1996</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.16		    $0.10</p>
<p> Net		 3,551		    2,110</p>
<p> Sales	     290,826		  276,458</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  22,599		   21,600</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>NOTES: First-quarter 1997 results include pretax acquisition-related charges of $300,000, and Q1 1996 results include pretax acquisition-related charges of $1.2 million, for the Baxter Industrial and Life Science acquisition in September 1995.</p>
<p>Full company name is VWR Scientific Products Corp.</p>
